	"FriendlyName": "FICSIT's performance manager",
	"Description": "Nine targeted repairs and diagnostics for standing multiplayer, rendering and stutter bugs. No performance governing yet. REPAIRS: static-base movement (stops rubber-banding on foundations) | rain occlusion (LogRainSystem errors measured 35-37 per session typical and 4,000+ in the worst session seen, to 0) | inventory init (sizes an uninitialised inventory instead of refusing items into it) | hologram net (rebuilds a replicated build preview's attachment points instead of skipping its BeginPlay) | asset residency (keeps four platform icons loaded so the player list stops blocking the game thread to load them on every bind). GUARD: no-owner RPC gate. DIAGNOSTICS, log-only, overriding nothing: hitch meter (frame time, which this build otherwise never measures) | clone sensor (join-time player-state candidate matching) | schematic probe. FPM never destroys player items, and drives no renderer settings.",
